GUIDE='<p class="g-lead">You say when you want to eat. Tempasto tells you what to do when. Here’s how, in five steps:</p><div class="gd-card"><div class="gd-h"><span class="g-n">1</span><b>Plan</b></div><div class="gd-demo gd-satz">Dinner is on <u>Friday at 7 PM</u>: <u>6 pizzas</u>.</div><p>Your plan is one sentence on the <b>Start</b> tab. Tap a word underlined in red to change the day, how many pizzas or the rise time. Tap the steps below it for the full schedule.</p></div><div class="gd-card"><div class="gd-h"><span class="g-n">2</span><b>Choose pizzas</b></div><div class="gd-demo gd-pz"><span class="gd-pzimg" aria-hidden="true"></span><b>Margherita</b><span class="gd-st"><i>−</i>2<i>+</i></span></div><p>On the <b>Pizzas</b> tab, tap <b>+</b> to pick what goes in the oven. Your own creations are at the bottom of the menu.</p></div><div class="gd-card"><div class="gd-h"><span class="g-n">3</span><b>Shopping</b></div><div class="gd-demo gd-list"><span class="done"><i class="ck" aria-hidden="true"></i>Caputo Cuoco<b>466 g</b></span><span><i class="bx" aria-hidden="true"></i>San Marzano tomatoes<b>300 g</b></span></div><p>The shopping list writes itself. Tap to check things off. Long-press anything you always have at home.</p></div><div class="gd-card"><div class="gd-h"><span class="g-n">4</span><b>Start the plan</b></div><div class="gd-demo gd-go"><span class="gd-pill">Start plan ▸</span><span class="gd-bell">Reminders on</span></div><p>From here on the app reminds you: to chill the water, to mix the dough and every step after that, even when it’s closed.</p></div><div class="gd-card"><div class="gd-h"><span class="g-n">5</span><b>Bake, step by step</b></div><div class="gd-demo gd-bake"><span class="gd-note"><small>Nonna’s tip</small>Keep the water nice and cold.</span><span class="gd-done">✓ Done</span></div><p>Bake mode walks you through every step. Tap <b>Done</b> and you’re on to the next one. Behind the button there’s always a note from Nonna.</p></div><div class="mgrp-h">Good to know</div><div class="gd-faq"><details><summary>Running late or done early?</summary><p>Tap “Running late?” in bake mode. The whole plan and all reminders move with it.</p></details><details><summary>Cancel the dough</summary><p>Tap “End” at the top of bake mode. You’ll have 5 seconds to undo it.</p></details><details><summary>Change the number of pizzas</summary><p>Before you start the plan, tap the number of pizzas on the Start tab. Once the dough is going, the number of dough balls is set, but you can still swap pizzas.</p></details><details><summary>Reminders</summary><p>Reminders begin when you start the plan. From then on the app pings you for every step, even when it’s closed. It stays quiet during your night rest.</p></details><details><summary>Underlined words</summary><p>Tap any word with a dotted underline, like autolyse or bulk ferment, for a quick explanation.</p></details><details><summary>Settings and language</summary><p>Oven, dough ball size, yeast and kneading are under More → Settings. Preferment, flour, temperatures and units live in expert mode. Change the language under More → Language.</p></details></div><button class="btn ghost" id="introOpen">Watch the short intro</button>'
GUIDE_EN=GUIDE
